    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/8e142dd6152d3df2f1a15733352970a9.avif?t=1749049260\" width=616 height=280 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The long-awaited game adaptation of Natsume\u2019s Book of Friends is here!</strong></h2>Step into the shoes of Takashi Natsume and spend an unforgettable summer vacation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spend an unforgettable summer as Takashi Natsume</strong></h2>The first term is over and summer vacation has finally begun.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/cc7b28f33a3be742c68d3a6afc4fd366.poster.avif?t=1749049260\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/cc7b28f33a3be742c68d3a6afc4fd366.webm?t=1749049260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/cc7b28f33a3be742c68d3a6afc4fd366.mp4?t=1749049260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Natsume weaves heartwarming stories through his encounters with various people.<br>Unravel their stories when you complete their requests.<br>There are five possible endings.<br>Enjoy an original story unique to the game\u2014an experience you won\u2019t find anywhere else.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strengthen Bonds Through \u201cGifts\u201d</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/2616271b08701ab780d807cf0fc6cb2b.avif?t=1749049260\" width=616 height=320 /></span><br>Collect a variety of items by fulfilling requests or shopping in town.<br>Gift these to your friends and strengthen your bonds.<br>You might surprise them, make them smile, or receive an unexpected response\u2014<br>New requests appear as your bonds strengthen!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Packed with Classic Summer Events</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/9499bc925df7bbfc2f2504a791c498ac.poster.avif?t=1749049260\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/9499bc925df7bbfc2f2504a791c498ac.webm?t=1749049260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Festivals, test of courage, fireworks displays...<br>Enjoy a lineup of nostalgic summer events.<br>Each moment is sure to become a lasting memory.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Beautifully Recreated World of Natsume\u2019s Book of Friends</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/e485e30a7b12e4840ed13e91a9a789be.poster.avif?t=1749049260\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/e485e30a7b12e4840ed13e91a9a789be.webm?t=1749049260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Warm and gently nostalgic.<br>Immerse yourself in the vibrant world and live out your days as \u201cNatsume.\u201d<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Journey Through Fond Memories</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/5707520e63dccb1d6de6fc50729224c8.poster.avif?t=1749049260\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/5707520e63dccb1d6de6fc50729224c8.webm?t=1749049260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Those precious encounters, those heartfelt emotions...<br>Some requests will bring back memorable scenes from Seasons 1 through 7 of the anime.<br>Relive Natsume\u2019s journey and reflect on the path he has walked.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/8e142dd6152d3df2f1a15733352970a9.avif?t=1749049260\" width=616 height=280 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The long-awaited game adaptation of Natsume\u2019s Book of Friends is here!</strong></h2>Step into the shoes of Takashi Natsume and spend an unforgettable summer vacation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spend an unforgettable summer as Takashi Natsume</strong></h2>The first term is over and summer vacation has finally begun.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/cc7b28f33a3be742c68d3a6afc4fd366.poster.avif?t=1749049260\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/cc7b28f33a3be742c68d3a6afc4fd366.webm?t=1749049260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/cc7b28f33a3be742c68d3a6afc4fd366.mp4?t=1749049260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Natsume weaves heartwarming stories through his encounters with various people.<br>Unravel their stories when you complete their requests.<br>There are five possible endings.<br>Enjoy an original story unique to the game\u2014an experience you won\u2019t find anywhere else.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strengthen Bonds Through \u201cGifts\u201d</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/2616271b08701ab780d807cf0fc6cb2b.avif?t=1749049260\" width=616 height=320 /></span><br>Collect a variety of items by fulfilling requests or shopping in town.<br>Gift these to your friends and strengthen your bonds.<br>You might surprise them, make them smile, or receive an unexpected response\u2014<br>New requests appear as your bonds strengthen!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Packed with Classic Summer Events</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/9499bc925df7bbfc2f2504a791c498ac.poster.avif?t=1749049260\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/9499bc925df7bbfc2f2504a791c498ac.webm?t=1749049260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Festivals, test of courage, fireworks displays...<br>Enjoy a lineup of nostalgic summer events.<br>Each moment is sure to become a lasting memory.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Beautifully Recreated World of Natsume\u2019s Book of Friends</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/e485e30a7b12e4840ed13e91a9a789be.poster.avif?t=1749049260\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/e485e30a7b12e4840ed13e91a9a789be.webm?t=1749049260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Warm and gently nostalgic.<br>Immerse yourself in the vibrant world and live out your days as \u201cNatsume.\u201d<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Journey Through Fond Memories</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/5707520e63dccb1d6de6fc50729224c8.poster.avif?t=1749049260\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/5707520e63dccb1d6de6fc50729224c8.webm?t=1749049260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Those precious encounters, those heartfelt emotions...<br>Some requests will bring back memorable scenes from Seasons 1 through 7 of the anime.<br>Relive Natsume\u2019s journey and reflect on the path he has walked.",
    "short_description": "\u201cNatsume's Book of Friends: Hazuki no Shirushi\u201d is an adventure game where you can experience summer vacation in the world of \u201cNatsume's Book of Friends\u201d. As the protagonist Takashi Natsume, you are able to meet other friends and spirits, and enjoy a wonderful summer time.",
